import{_ as n,o,c as t,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 873 | Transcended Ones and Economy · Overview — The Transcended One's Economic Role","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 873 | Transcended Ones and Economy · Overview — The Transcended One's Economic Role","no":873,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Economy","Economic Role","Increment Development","More-Work-More-Pay"],"related":["06-More-Work-More-Pay Distribution Principle","22-Resource Allocation Household-Responsibility Mechanism","04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis","717-Increment Development and Resource Creation Post"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0873_模块4-超脱者与经济-总论.md","filePath":"en/0873_模块4-超脱者与经济-总论.md"}`),a={name:"en/0873_模块4-超脱者与经济-总论.md"};function r(s,e,c,l,d,h){return o(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-873-transcended-ones-and-economy-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-economic-role" tabindex="-1">Entry 873 | Transcended Ones and Economy · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Economic Role <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-873-transcended-ones-and-economy-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-economic-role" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 873 | Transcended Ones and Economy · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Economic Role&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 06, 22, 04, 717</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-transcended-one-is-not-an-economic-lord-but-an-increment-engineer" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the transcended one is not an economic lord, but an increment engineer <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-transcended-one-is-not-an-economic-lord-but-an-increment-engineer" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the transcended one is not an economic lord, but an increment engineer&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s strong ones have only two attitudes toward the economy: either ignore it (closed-door cultivation, let mortals struggle on their own), or fully control it (take all resources for themselves, distribute by mood). The former is economic anarchy; the latter is economic dictatorship. Neither produces true prosperity. Heng Yuan Zhou must answer: <strong>what does the transcended one actually do in Myriad Ranks&#39; economic system?</strong> The answer is: he is not a lord, not a predator; he is an increment engineer — continuously making the cake bigger, not staring at how to divide the cake. This entry is the economy sub-theme overview.</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: the anti-predation axiom requires economic activity not consume stock or prey on the weak; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires economic results be shared by Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires the economy serve civilization&#39;s overall evolution; the causal self-discipline axiom requires economic allocation be traceable throughout; the law-first axiom requires economic laws be self-consistent, not distorted by the transcended one&#39;s personal will; the universal equal infinite law confirms all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; easygoing layabouts retain a floor and are not eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher infinity — infinite origin is inherent in all, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-old-world-s-economy-inevitable-collapse" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Old World&#39;s Economy Inevitable Collapse <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-old-world-s-economy-inevitable-collapse" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Old World&#39;s Economy Inevitable Collapse&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s cultivation-civilization economic model has a fundamental bug: <strong>it is zero-sum.</strong></p><ul><li>Spiritual veins are just that many; if you occupy them, others have none;</li><li>Secret realms are just that big; those who enter first take it; those behind only drink the northwest wind;</li><li>Manuals are just a few sets; transmitted to you, cannot be transmitted to him.</li></ul><p>Zero-sum economy&#39;s end is monopoly: whoever is strongest takes the most, then divides more to his confidants and descendants. Bottom-level cultivators forever struggle on the starvation line. This is not economic law; this is predatory law — the economy is only predation&#39;s outer garment.</p><p>When stock is exhausted and new resources cannot be discovered, the economy collapses. The old world shuffles the deck every era; essentially zero-sum economy&#39;s periodic collapse.</p><h2 id="ii-heng-yuan-zhou-s-economic-base-increment-first" tabindex="-1">II. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Economic Base: Increment First <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-heng-yuan-zhou-s-economic-base-increment-first" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Economic Base: Increment First&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s economic system&#39;s first axiom is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s expression in the economic field: <strong>develop increments, do not consume stock.</strong></p><p>This is not a slogan, but a whole set of economic engineering:</p><ol><li><strong>New-plane frontier</strong>: the transcended one continuously discovers new cosmoses, new planes, new resource belts, making the cake bigger (see entries 719, 765);</li><li><strong>New-law weaving</strong>: the transcended one deduces new laws, &quot;creating&quot; resources that did not exist (see entry 752);</li><li><strong>Energy circulation</strong>: through Myriad-Rank origin bidirectional circulation, let energy flow and appreciate among Myriad Ranks, not hoarded by some person;</li><li><strong>Technology inclusion</strong>: Multiplication Fruit technologization (Documents 16, 61), spatial-law technology (Documents 13, 62), and other public technologies lower Myriad Ranks&#39; production cost.</li></ol><p>Increment economy&#39;s logic is: <strong>no need to grab, because there is always new.</strong> As long as the transcended one is opening increments, Myriad Ranks need not tear at each other over stock.</p><h2 id="iii-the-transcended-one-s-economic-role-four-quadrant" tabindex="-1">III. The Transcended One&#39;s Economic Role Four-Quadrant <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-transcended-one-s-economic-role-four-quadrant" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Transcended One&#39;s Economic Role Four-Quadrant&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s role in the economic system may be summarized by four quadrants:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>What to Do</th><th>What Not to Do</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Increment engineer</td><td>Open new planes, new resources, new laws</td><td>Do not prey on stock</td></tr><tr><td>Allocation supervisor</td><td>Supervise more-work-more-pay, household-responsibility execution</td><td>Do not privately allocate</td></tr><tr><td>Anti-monopolist</td><td>Strike resource monopoly, prevent small-circle hoarding</td><td>Himself do not monopolize</td></tr><tr><td>Infrastructure provider</td><td>Build public cultivation places, public compute, public transport</td><td>Do not run a private economic empire</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Four quadrants together, the transcended one&#39;s economic role is: <strong>the person making the cake, not the person cutting the cake; the person fixing the pipes, not the person hoarding water.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-the-transcended-one-and-currency-metering-transaction" tabindex="-1">IV. The Transcended One and Currency, Metering, Transaction <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-transcended-one-and-currency-metering-transaction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Transcended One and Currency, Metering, Transaction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s economic system has a complete set of infrastructure (Document 65 Energy Standardization and Metering, Document 66 Cross-Plane Communications, Document 67 Anchor Hardware); the transcended one&#39;s role in it is maintainer not issuer:</p><ul><li>Energy standardization is executed by professional institutions; the transcended one does not manipulate energy currency value;</li><li>Cross-plane transactions settle automatically through the anchor network; the transcended one does not set toll gates;</li><li>Transaction records all leave traces under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, eliminating insider trading.</li></ul><p>The transcended one does not use information advantage or compute advantage to arbitrage in the economy. He knows tomorrow which plane will be developed, but he cannot in advance &quot;buy land&quot; there — this is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s concrete application in the economy.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: zero-sum economy wastes energy on contesting stock; increment economy uses energy on creating new resources</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: developing increments not preying on stock, cutting predation motive at the economic root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo economy is grace economy — he gives what Myriad Ranks use; the ceiling is his grace amount; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s economy is increment economy, the ceiling rises infinitely with new-plane frontier</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: economic results are shared across five Myriad-Rank lineages, impartial</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: economic infrastructure, allocation rules, and transaction records all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s economic role is increment engineer, not economic lord. His job is to make the cake bigger, fix the pipes, break monopoly, lay infrastructure to every plane. When Myriad Ranks no longer need to tear over stock, when increments are always being opened, the economy is no longer predation&#39;s outer garment, but symbiosis&#39; tool. This is the transcended one&#39;s orthodox definition in the economic dimension.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/06-多劳多得分配原理.html">Entry 06 · More-Work-More-Pay Distribution Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">Entry 22 · Resource Allocation Household-Responsibility Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/717_模块4-增量开发与资源创造岗.html">Entry 717 · Increment Development and Resource Creation Post</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=n(a,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
